## End-to-end flow

```
memo update side effect
  → DispatchMemoUpdatedWebhook (memo_service_webhooks.go)
  → PostAsync (webhook.go)
  → worker goroutine → Post (webhook.go)
  → safeClient.Do → safeDialContext → isReservedIP
```

**Protection summary:** `ValidateURL` blocks bad URLs at webhook registration; `safeDialContext` + `isReservedIP` block internal/reserved targets again at actual HTTP connect time.
